  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "A wire of length <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>314</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math> carrying current of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>14</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> is bent to form a circle. The magnetic moment of the coil is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>. [Given <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>14</mn></math>]",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "11",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/77f709af-8d1f-42ab-983f-65ae726407ba-image.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 90px;\" /></p><p>Length of the wire&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>l</mi></math>&nbsp;when bent&nbsp;becomes circumference&nbsp;of the loop, whose radius is given by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>l</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>314</mn><mrow><mn>100</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>14</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p><p>Magnetic moment of the coil is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>I</mi><mi>A</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>&#960;</mi><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>14</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>99</mn><mo>&#8776;</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>00</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p></blockquote>",
